              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Luka 9:24",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JHN.12.25"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Johana 12:25",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mutu yeyesi ndiye dzishuulisha na maishage himu duniani bahi, andaangamiza maishage ga kare na kare, ela aangamizaye maishage ga himu duniani andarinda maishage ga kare na kare. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakuambirani, usiku uho ndiokpwedzera mimi, atu airi andakala arere chitanda chimwenga, mmwenga andahalwa na wanjina arichwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Achetu airi andakala anasaga, mmwenga andahalwa na wanjina andarichwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alume airi andakala mundani anahenda kazi phamwenga, mmwenga andahalwa na wanjina andarichwa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17:36",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Vitabu vyanjina vya kare tavina msitari huno wa 36.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 17:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anafundzie achimuuza, “Bwana, mambo higa gandakala kuphi?” Naye achiaambira, “Pho pharipho na lufu, ndipho nderi nkukutana.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.17.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.17.37"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
